{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#card-zh","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 是一款面向 DSH Web 的上下文插件，可按会话开启每轮独立模式。它在每轮开始时将更早的可见历史折叠为占位节点，同时保留会话树记录，并可把用户设置的长期规则注入系统提示。界面在输入区提供开关和规则编辑对话框，规则与启用状态按会话保存。适合重复输入且希望规则稳定、上下文占用不随历史增长的场景；需本地 DSH 环境，不需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-259","lib/index.js:426-489","client.js:315-338"]}
{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#card-en","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation adds per-turn context isolation to DSH Web. Earlier turns fold into a placeholder while the transcript stays visible. It injects a saved rule each turn and offers a web toggle for session settings. Useful for repetitive tasks needing stable instructions and bounded context.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-259","lib/index.js:426-489","client.js:315-338"]}
