{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#feature-1","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 的功能「每轮折叠旧历史」：开启后在新一轮第一步把此前可见节点替换为占位节点，界面仍保留会话树；仅在工具调用配对平衡时执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-259","lib/index.js:430-455"]}
{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#feature-2","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 的功能「长期规则」：用户在输入区开关对话框中填写规则后，插件按当前会话把规则贡献到系统提示，每轮装配时读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:269-290","client.js:219-240"]}
{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#feature-3","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 的功能「会话设置」：网页输入区按钮打开规则编辑框，状态通过本地接口按 sessionId 读取和保存，也可关闭隔离。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:152-188","client.js:219-286","lib/index.js:381-409"]}
