{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#caveat-1","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 使用前须知：开启后旧轮次折叠且关闭功能也不会恢复到模型上下文；长期规则会进入系统提示并随请求发给所用模型。见 lib/index.js:247-257、269-284。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:247-257","lib/index.js:269-284"]}
{"unit_id":"xinshang777__dsh-per-turn-isolation#caveat-2","repo":"xinshang777/dsh-per-turn-isolation","commit":"77129c0c3b5eb3b71a1c6de6b1b3748c53d14c19","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-turn-isolation 使用前须知：开关和规则保存在 DSH_HOME 下的 JSON 文件，默认 ~/.dsh；文件含自定义规则文本。见 lib/index.js:65-74、114-123。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:65-74","lib/index.js:114-123"]}
